# 1. Project Overview

## Purpose

The Speaking Portfolio System is a SharePoint-based web application designed to support speaking assessment in language learning courses.

Students upload recordings of speaking activities, receive AI-generated transcripts, edit transcripts to contain only their own speech, and submit their work for assessment.

Teachers can review recordings, compare partner submissions, evaluate student participation, provide grades, and export speaking metrics.

Administrators can manage teachers, oversee classes, and generate institution-wide reports.

---

# 2. Project Goals

The system should:

- Reduce teacher workload for speaking assessment.
- Provide meaningful participation metrics.
- Support speaking portfolio assessment.
- Make transcript creation simple for students.
- Integrate with Microsoft 365 authentication.
- Operate primarily within SharePoint Online.
- Support at least 800 students.
- Support future expansion.

