# 4. User Roles

## Student

Students participate in speaking activities and submit work.

### Permissions

Can:

- View own assignments
- Create submissions
- Edit own transcripts
- View own grades
- View own feedback

Cannot:

- View other students' submissions
- View teacher data
- Access administrative features

---

## Teacher

Teachers manage classes and assess student work.

### Permissions

Can:

- View assigned classes
- Create assignments
- Review submissions
- Listen to audio files
- Grade students
- Export reports

Cannot:

- Access classes assigned to other teachers

---

## Administrator

Administrators manage system-wide operations.

### Permissions

Can:

- View all classes
- View all assignments
- View all submissions
- Manage teachers
- Export system-wide data

Administrators may also perform teacher functions.

