# 5. Functional Requirements

# Authentication

## FR-001

Users shall authenticate using Microsoft 365 credentials.

### Acceptance Criteria

- User can sign in using university account.
- No separate password is required.
- User role is assigned automatically.

---

# Student Features

## FR-101 View Assignments

Students shall be able to view all available assignments.

### Acceptance Criteria

- Assignments are displayed by class.
- Assignment status is visible.
- Assignment due date is visible.

---

## FR-102 Select Partners

Students shall be able to select partners from a teacher-defined list.

### Acceptance Criteria

- Available partners are displayed.
- Selected partners are stored with the submission.

---

## FR-103 Upload Audio

Students shall be able to upload audio recordings.

### Supported Formats

- MP3
- M4A
- WAV

### Acceptance Criteria

- Upload progress is visible.
- Upload success is confirmed.
- Audio file is stored.

---

## FR-104 Generate Transcript

The system shall generate a transcript from uploaded audio.

### Acceptance Criteria

- Transcript generation begins automatically.
- Transcript is attached to the submission.
- Student can edit transcript.
- Transcript remains available after page refresh.

### Performance Goal

- Initial transcription results should begin appearing within approximately 10 seconds when technically feasible.

---

## FR-105 Edit Transcript

Students shall be able to edit generated transcripts.

### Acceptance Criteria

- Transcript is editable.
- Changes can be saved.
- Transcript can be reopened later.

---

## FR-106 Submit Transcript

Students shall submit a final transcript.

### Acceptance Criteria

- Submission timestamp is recorded.
- Submission status changes to Submitted.
- Teacher can review submission.

---

