# 14. Success Criteria

The MVP is considered successful when:

1. Students can upload audio files.
2. Audio files can be transcribed automatically.
3. Students can edit transcripts.
4. Students can submit final transcripts.
5. Word count is generated automatically.
6. Turn count is generated automatically.
7. Average words per turn is generated automatically.
8. Teachers can review submissions.
9. Teachers can assign grades.
10. Teachers can export CSV reports.
11. Administrators can view all classes.
12. The system operates within the Microsoft 365 ecosystem.
